# Generated OpenFOAM mesh, decompositions and runtime compilation
**/polyMesh/
**/processor*/
**/dynamicCode/
**/postProcessing/
**/Make/linux*/
*.o
*.so
*.dep
*.foam

# OpenFOAM time output; retain the case's initial fields in 0/
cases/*/data/openfoam/*/[0-9]*/
!cases/*/data/openfoam/*/0/
!cases/*/data/openfoam/*/0/**
cases/tripleflame/data/reaction/1d-freeflame/[0-9]*/
!cases/tripleflame/data/reaction/1d-freeflame/0/
!cases/tripleflame/data/reaction/1d-freeflame/0/**
